# Use Claude rules

`.claude/rules/` is the single source of truth for this repo. The files below are
injected as context; follow them as if they were Cursor rules.

@CLAUDE.md
@.claude/rules/karpathy-guidelines.md
@.claude/rules/concise-answers.md
@.claude/rules/language-policy.md
@.claude/rules/commit-message.md
@.claude/rules/autonomous-agent.md
@.claude/rules/ponytail.md

If a Cursor rule and a Claude rule conflict, follow the Claude rule unless the
user says otherwise. Do not copy these files into `.cursor/rules/`.
